      "text": "Coast Guard Aviators: Always Ready, Always Above \n\nBold. Skilled. Fearless. For over 100 years, Coast Guard aviators have been soaring into danger to save lives, protect our maritime borders, and defend our Nation. \n\nThese aviation heroes are the backbone of Coast Guard excellence, from daring rescues in the roughest seas to ongoing operations to control, secure, and defend U.S. borders, Today, on National Aviation Day, we honor their dedication, courage, and the rich history of Coast Guard aviation. \n\nThank you to the Coasties who take to the skies to keep us safe. Semper Paratus! \n#uscg #finestmilitary #aviation",
