      "text": "At the U.S. Coast Guard, readiness isn’t just about today—it’s about preparing for the challenges of tomorrow. Through Force Design 2028, we’re integrating advanced tech like robotic and autonomous systems into our operations. By innovating and acquiring these systems at a historic pace, we are enhancing our capabilities and adapting to meet the nation’s needs.\n\nThis is transformation at work.\n\nSee how we’re shaping the future of maritime security. Learn more: https://t.co/kseIMZRolS",
