      "text": "Coast  Guard Divers: Respect the Depth\n\nBold. Skilled. Dedicated. For over 80 years, Coast Guard divers have been the silent force beneath the waves, tackling missions that demand  expertise and courage.\n\nFrom WWII sabotage missions to Cold War ship inspections, and today’s counterterrorism sweeps and underwater archeological surveys, these  elite divers are masters of the underwater world. Their work is a testament to the Coast Guard’s reputation as the finest maritime fighting force.\n\nDive into their incredible legacy and honor the unsung heroes who take the plunge.\n#USCG #FinestMilitary #divers",
      "text_resolved": "Coast  Guard Divers: Respect the Depth\n\nBold. Skilled. Dedicated. For over 80 years, Coast Guard divers have been the silent force beneath the waves, tackling missions that demand  expertise and courage.\n\nFrom WWII sabotage missions to Cold War ship inspections, and today’s counterterrorism sweeps and underwater archeological surveys, these  elite divers are masters of the underwater world. Their work is a testament to the Coast Guard’s reputation as the finest maritime fighting force.\n\nDive into their incredible legacy and honor the unsung heroes who take the plunge.\n#USCG #FinestMilitary #divers",
