      "text": "Mission Ready: V-BAT Completes Operational Testing with the U.S. Coast Guard!   \n  \nWith a perfect score aboard Cutter Midgett, the V-BAT is set to continue our modernization under Force Design 2028. This next-gen UAS delivers vital intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance capabilities, enhancing our layered approach to maritime border security and ensuring we remain Always Ready.  \n  \nWatch this video to see the V-BAT in action. \n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
